    "detailed_description": "Join a few blocks here, a little there and watch the blocks unite like magic.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBBlocks is a fun game for you to train your agility and reasoning skills.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYour goal is to position as many blocks as possible in the right position, if the blocks reach the sky, you lose.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIf you join the blocks in the right position they will come together and disappear, if they get in the wrong position they will continue there.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPass levels, increase punctuation, do everything you need, just do not let the blocks reach the sky.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAre you ready for the adventure?",
